{
  "about": "When two cmd templates can be the same bytes (cmdsOverlap, and BlockedCmds asked about one cmd added to it): as many tokens, and each the same byte or a {placeholder} on either side. Hex is matched without case. Shared by the Patchsprite app and the sniffer; the cmds are made up.",
